# slice 2 of the receiver `table`: a source that asks no primitive question (its whole body is the letter
# to the host) with no primitive.lm2 beside it (harness Primitive = absent): the translator's tables are
# read at the start, so it is refused once -- "primitive.lm2: cannot read a table file of the translator"
# (read at the first question, it would need none).

sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
